# Attention mechanism facade.
#
# Public import: importa ex "gradus:attention" privata attention
# Depends on: gradus:tensor, gradus:gradient, gradus:nn
#
# Will split into nested leaves when ≥2 attention variants are implemented:
#   gradus:attention/scaled_dot_product  scaled dot-product attention
#   gradus:attention/causal              causal masking
#   gradus:attention/multi_head          multi-head composition
#
# Architectural rule: attention is a building block, not a transformer
# component. This module must not import from gradus:transformer.
